# HARROWBY 03 -- the Cotters' longhouse, by hand, on the generated scaffold.
#
# House frame: y = 0 floor, +z the FRONT (door at x -9..-1, z 28), the back
# door opposite (x -29..-21, z -29): a cross passage. x -69..70 wall to wall.
#   x -69..-45  the BYRE: the gable (left, -x) door, two stalls, mangers
#   x -45..28   the HALL: the open central hearth (x -28..-17, z -6..5),
#               the board and benches, the meal chest, Maud's shelf
#   x 31..70    the inner room under the sleeping LOFT (loft floor y 26)
# In the world the longhouse faces south (yaw 0) onto the green.
{"cmd": "struct.open", "args": {"ref": "harrowby/longhouse"}}

